The system shall allow the user to view available playback decks and their 
associated queues.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: UR-042

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SR-101
TITLE: Identifying Active Playback Decks
STATEMENT: >>>
The system shall distinguish playback decks that are currently playing audio 
from decks that are not playing audio.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: UR-043

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SR-102
